        <h5 style="text-align: left;">Remarks:</h5>
        <p>1. The battery is non-removable, removing it may cause damage to the device.</p>
        <p>2. Power consumption data are from Ulefone lab, which will be varied by actual usage.</p>
        <p>3. Product size and weight may vary by configuration, manufacturing process and measurements. All specifications are subject to the actual product.</p>
        <p>4.RugKing Pad Pro is splash, water, and dust resistant and was tested under controlled laboratory conditions with a rating of IP68 under IEC standard 60529 (maximum depth of 1.5 meters up to 30 minutes). Charger and accessories are not water-resistant. Splash, water and dust resistance are not permanent and might decrease as a result of normal wear. Do not attempt to charge a wet RugKing Pad Pro. Liquid damage not covered under warranty.</p>
        <p>5. RugKing Pad Pro has waterproof plugs for its charging port and audio jack, please tightly put the plugs into the holes before you put an RugKing Pad Pro into water.</p>
        <p>6. The Custom Key and its ability to quickly access different functions excluding SOS and flashlight work only when the screen is unlocked.</p>
        <p>7. The actual available RAM and storage are less than the listed total capacity due to the occupied storage of the operating system and software pre-installed in the device. The dynamic RAM can be activated in Settings at your will.</p>
        <p>8. The micro SD card is not included, and need to be purchased separately. It is recommended to use Class 10 memory cards, other types of memory cards are not guaranteed to be fully compatible.</p>
        <p>9. 8.68 inches is the diagonal length of the display when the four rounded corners are taken to be pointed corners, the actual viewable area is slightly smaller.</p>
        <p>10. The resolution is measured as a standard rectangle with a rounded corners design, the effective pixels are slightly less.</p>
        <p>11. The camera software functions are subject to the actual presence, some of functions and names may vary depending on the software version.</p>
        <p>12. The actual photo and video resolution may vary depending on the shooting mode.</p>
        <p>13. NFC and Google Pay is supported, and you are suggested to download Google Pay to use it; the available countries and regions are for your reference: https://pay.google.com/about.</p>
        <p>14. The product, accessories, and package may vary in different markets. Pictures are for reference only. Please refer to the actual products.</p>
        <p>15. For more devices that are compatible with uSmart Expansion Connector, refer to our accessories page. External devices require additional purchases.</p>
        <p>20. Due to the difference of material and thickness, some leather gloves may be incompatible.</p>
        <p>21. Pictures for demonstration purpose only. The effectiveness and availability may vary for actual software.</p>
        <p>22. Before activating the eSIM, please confirm support and eligibility with your cellular carrier, as service varies by region.</p>
        <p>23. All power consumption data above are from Ulefone lab tests and may vary with actual usage.</p>
